  "description": "A Microsoft Agent Framework AIAgent on a GitHub Copilot runtime AgentKit starts and owns (the installed Copilot CLI by default, version-checked, or the SDK's bundled runtime on request; Empty mode, the host's COPILOT_ and GITHUB_COPILOT_ variables withheld apart from an allow-listed credential, network and telemetry-off set, a data directory AgentKit owns), which suppresses the Copilot runtime's built-in tools through a source-qualified allow-list derived from the supplied tools, plus an AgentKit compacting session over the same runtime",
